<div class="wizard-shell"><header><p class="eyebrow">Create a classless character</p><h1>Ready for the field</h1><p>5 Attribute points · 10 Skill points · 2 basic Disciplines. Your progress is saved as you go.</p></header><nav class="wizard-steps" aria-label="Creation progress">{{#each steps}}<button type="button" class="{{#if active}}active{{/if}}" data-action="dispatch" data-command="step" data-step="{{index}}">{{label}}</button>{{/each}}</nav><div class="wizard-content">
{{#if identity}}<h2>Who are you?</h2><label>Name<input name="name" value="{{draft.name}}" required></label><label>Background<textarea name="background" rows="3">{{draft.background}}</textarea></label><label>Description<textarea name="description" rows="3">{{draft.description}}</textarea></label><label>Motivation<input name="motivation" value="{{draft.motivation}}"></label><label>Connection or complication<input name="connection" value="{{draft.connection}}"></label>{{/if}}
{{#if attributesStep}}<div class="section-heading"><h2>Attributes</h2><b class="points">{{attributeLeft}} points remaining</b></div><p>Each starts at zero. Spend five points; maximum two in any Attribute.</p><div class="point-grid">{{#each attributes}}<div class="point-card"><b>{{label}}</b><div class="stepper"><button type="button" data-action="dispatch" data-command="point" data-kind="attributes" data-key="{{id}}" data-delta="-1" aria-label="Decrease {{label}}" {{#if min}}disabled{{/if}}>−</button><output>{{value}}</output><button type="button" data-action="dispatch" data-command="point" data-kind="attributes" data-key="{{id}}" data-delta="1" aria-label="Increase {{label}}" {{#if max}}disabled{{/if}}>+</button></div></div>{{/each}}</div>{{/if}}
{{#if skillsStep}}<div class="section-heading"><h2>Skills</h2><b class="points">{{skillLeft}} points remaining</b></div><p>Spend ten points; maximum three in any Skill. Two ranks in a relevant Skill unlock basic Disciplines.</p><div class="point-grid">{{#each skills}}<div class="point-card"><b>{{label}}</b><div class="stepper"><button type="button" data-action="dispatch" data-command="point" data-kind="skills" data-key="{{id}}" data-delta="-1" aria-label="Decrease {{label}}" {{#if min}}disabled{{/if}}>−</button><output>{{value}}</output><button type="button" data-action="dispatch" data-command="point" data-kind="skills" data-key="{{id}}" data-delta="1" aria-label="Increase {{label}}" {{#if max}}disabled{{/if}}>+</button></div></div>{{/each}}</div>{{/if}}
{{#if disciplinesStep}}<div class="section-heading"><h2>Basic Disciplines</h2><b class="points">{{disciplineLeft}} choices remaining</b></div><p>Disciplines unlock trained item actions. You still need compatible equipment.</p><div class="point-grid">{{#each disciplines}}<button type="button" class="discipline-card {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}" data-action="dispatch" data-command="discipline" data-id="{{id}}" {{#if disabled}}disabled{{/if}}><b>{{name}}</b><small>Requires {{skill}} {{rank}}</small>{{#if selected}}<small>Selected</small>{{/if}}</button>{{/each}}</div>{{/if}}
{{#if loadoutStep}}<h2>Starting loadout</h2><p>Choose a GM-approved loadout. Each firearm receives three separately tracked compatible sources. Worn protection and routine small supplies use no loadout slot.</p><label>Primary<select name="primary">{{#each weapons}}<option value="{{id}}" {{#if primary}}selected{{/if}}>{{name}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label><label>Secondary<select name="secondary">{{#each weapons}}<option value="{{id}}" {{#if secondary}}selected{{/if}}>{{name}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label><label>Tertiary<select name="tertiary">{{#each weapons}}<option value="{{id}}" {{#if tertiary}}selected{{/if}}>{{name}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label><label>Worn armour<select name="armour">{{#each armours}}<option value="{{id}}" {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}>{{name}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label>{{/if}}
{{#if review}}<h2>Review {{draft.name}}</h2><div class="stat-grid"><div>{{attributeLeft}} Attribute points unspent</div><div>{{skillLeft}} Skill points unspent</div><div>{{disciplineLeft}} Discipline choices unspent</div></div>{{#each errors}}<p class="danger">{{this}}</p>{{else}}<p class="notice">All point budgets and Discipline prerequisites are valid.</p>{{/each}}<p>Creation starts at zero Wounds and Pressure, Level 1, and no VP. Loadout items are issued once. You can review any tab before finishing.</p>{{/if}}
</div><footer class="wizard-footer"><button type="button" data-action="dispatch" data-command="back" {{#if first}}disabled{{/if}}>Back</button>{{#if last}}<button type="button" data-action="dispatch" data-command="finish" {{#if errors.length}}disabled{{/if}}>Create character</button>{{else}}<button type="button" data-action="dispatch" data-command="next">Next</button>{{/if}}</footer></div>
